# Embedded English pronunciation dictionary for oca-music.
#
# Format: one word per line: `word P H O N E M E S` (ARPAbet-like tokens,
# stress digit on vowels only). Words not listed here fall back to the
# rule-based grapheme-to-phoneme engine (g2p.rs). Entries cover function
# words, irregulars the rules cannot derive ("love", "one", "through"), and
# high-frequency song vocabulary where vowel quality matters for rhymes.
# User `dictionary.yaml` overrides any entry.

